    EXT_CFG --> T_TOOL
    CHAT_CTRL --> T_MSG
    HITL_SVC --> T_HITL
    MGMT_CTRL --> T_BIZ
    DLV_SVC --> T_BIZ
    ASSET_SVC --> T_BIZ
    BATCH_SVC --> T_BIZ
    GUARD --> T_SEQ
    SAVER --> T_CK
    FACTORY -.-> T_KEY
    AUTH --> T_USER
    SEC -.-> AUTH

